<body>
    <h1>How to Configure Single Sign-On (SSO) on IGEL OS 12</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p local-id=3D"13f701b8-8d80-4a2a-b297-e715a9ccba9d">With IGEL OS 1=
2, you can use Single Sign-On (SSO) via a cloud-based identity provider (Id=
P) to access the local device and apps.&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"7825d279-de90-4f48-b4a0-ae99260623d7">The following&nbsp;ide=
ntity providers are supported:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"ef00fe3d-9547-4907-b338-66daa3bc4177">
<li local-id=3D"7561c04d-c183-416f-b92b-a3d356c5e0c3">
<p local-id=3D"989bea13-c810-460a-991b-fa47b6ad8c97">Okta</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"28d0f248-c98c-46c6-b22a-14fe39ec1fe7">
<p local-id=3D"60342729-73e5-4a86-9a41-3078e8a2706e">Microsoft Entra ID (fo=
rmerly known as Microsoft Azure AD)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"96f91112-e56c-465a-9f8d-5807681af75a">
<p local-id=3D"887b7101-9af8-4dfa-8a05-6d68d3020e13">Ping Identity | PingOn=
e</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ab496d26-d9a5-4d03-a2f1-8e482401efe0">
<p local-id=3D"8a34e866-53cc-4359-b417-5c3aef63f5bd">Omnissa Workspace ONE =
Access</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"13097710-441e-496a-8320-a4dbc6cd3050">Generally, IGEL OS 12 =
supports OpenID Connect authentication. For IdPs that adhere closely to thi=
s standard, there is a good chance that they can be used with IGEL OS 12.<b=
r></p>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-inf=
ormation">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-informa=
tion-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p local-id=3D"bad4c185-b0ef-4329-8559-eefa1be5bf5b">Generally, you can edi=
t the IGEL OS 12 device configuration as follows:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"a108f6e7-9161-48b2-8892-b140cd996dad">
<li local-id=3D"d0ed0cae-8a20-4984-a3ba-11167e195662">
<p local-id=3D"3921e7da-0ff2-4518-b537-ba422d07a7ce">via the IGEL UMS Web A=
pp:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"e5b9643e-f4cf-478b-b55b-c6df4acc9383">
<li local-id=3D"72be4a57-6b56-48e7-b436-892c6b85d53e">
<p local-id=3D"8464acff-cfe9-4e1d-838b-4e9b89e86111"><strong>Configuration =
&gt; Create new profile</strong>&nbsp;<span class=3D"confluence-embedded-fi=
le-wrapper"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-imag=
e-inline" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"b142bff45b5784c78657e4d651e4f36367c6c6e74=
58515ded6c52908be2cd1ca" data-image-src=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/=
wiki/download/attachments/73302505/image2022-7-27_11-58-12.png?version=3D1&=
amp;modificationDate=3D1716364690786&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" dat=
a-height=3D"35" data-width=3D"40" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-=
linked-resource-id=3D"73309200" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-lin=
ked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"imag=
e2022-7-27_11-58-12.png" data-base-url=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/w=
iki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-c=
ontainer-id=3D"73302505" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"31" data=
-media-id=3D"22f3c6be-a61a-42e4-89a7-7ecd35c11868" data-media-type=3D"file"=
 width=3D"40" height=3D"35"></span></p>
<p local-id=3D"fe084a94-6d57-482d-8596-a3ac49331a48">(You select one or sev=
eral apps that will be configured by the profile. If the IGEL OS base syste=
m app is selected, all other apps are shown under the tab "Apps"; if not, e=
ach app is displayed as a separate tab)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"35915e48-c219-46df-bfd0-f27f81c483e7">
<p local-id=3D"e3a93e72-9f87-43f2-b303-ecf369b7a139"><strong>Apps &gt;&nbsp=
;[name of the app] &gt; Create new profile</strong>&nbsp;(<span class=3D"le=
gacy-color-text-blue3">used to quickly configure a profile for the selected=
 app. It is also possible to add other apps that will be configured by this=
 profile</span>)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"20f57d49-c184-4f16-b1a2-3817851354bc">
<p local-id=3D"fe1f976f-0ab7-4fa7-8dce-49cff2ebd58e"><strong>Devices &gt;&n=
bsp;[name of the device] &gt; Edit Configuration</strong>&nbsp;(shows all i=
nstalled apps. Apps are displayed under the tab "Apps"</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"1ae79b60-2351-481c-89a7-3673d10e556f">
<p local-id=3D"dbe3b70b-b22d-4e97-a9f2-ce380649880c">via IGEL Setup locally=
 on the device (shows all installed apps. Apps are displayed under the tab =
"Apps")</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"bba4d0de-a22d-4c12-83fc-2d076bdd7159">The best practice to c=
onfigure your devices is via profiles. For details on how to create profile=
s, see&nbsp;<a class=3D"unresolved" href=3D"#">(en) IGEL UMS 12: Basic Conf=
iguration</a> .</p>
</div>
</div>
<h2 local-id=3D"9b723d31-1873-437e-ac51-b3bb436de7c8" id=3D"HowtoConfigureS=
ingleSign-On(SSO)onIGELOS12-AppsandUtilitiesforIGELOS12ThatSupportSSOwithMi=
crosoftEntraIDAppsandUtilitiesforIGELOS12thatSupportSSOwithAzureAD">Apps an=
d Utilities for IGEL OS 12 That Support SSO with Microsoft Entra ID<span cl=
ass=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"HowtoConfigureSingleSign-On(SSO)onIGEL=
OS12-AppsandUtilitiesforIGELOS12thatSupportSSOwithAzureAD"><span class=3D"c=
onfluence-anchor-link" id=3D"AppsandUtilitiesforIGELOS12thatSupportSSOwithA=
zureAD"></span></span></h2>
<ul local-id=3D"d5f9c0fb-88de-41f3-abca-e2ca9dc3f977">
<li local-id=3D"f5eb6d4a-a022-45c8-82d7-5b9f6eb1ae7e">
<p local-id=3D"69f67c86-42ef-4405-9b8e-699bb49be7b8">IGEL Azure Virtual Des=
ktop Client&nbsp;(AVD)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"fb2694b4-f2a0-476d-963d-224d3a1216af">
<p local-id=3D"6c60d7ed-57b0-4674-afc3-28fe644f3eb7">Zoom client (SSO via C=
hromium)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7a880940-6d79-4e36-be01-c2208eede261">
<p local-id=3D"e0605359-6e5f-4a9a-9943-c312aaadddb8">Web apps, e. g. Office=
 365 (SSO via Chromium)&nbsp;</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8f48908e-1c58-4cac-b1f1-5c6b4abf370c">
<p local-id=3D"1289e6e5-ba05-4c45-9a6d-4bcf0074f168">Device login</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"87a4ee7b-e0f6-43b1-81eb-7d533e1231c3">
<p local-id=3D"b2f6015b-d9e8-4b4b-b597-bd794bd48d31">Screenlock</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"bc84a8d5-a1fd-478f-b407-138e8f62842a" id=3D"HowtoConfigureS=
ingleSign-On(SSO)onIGELOS12-AppsandUtilitiesforIGELOS12ThatSupportSSOwithOk=
taAppsandUtilitiesforIGELOS12thatSupportSSOwithOkta">Apps and Utilities for=
 IGEL OS 12 That Support SSO with Okta<span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link=
" id=3D"HowtoConfigureSingleSign-On(SSO)onIGELOS12-AppsandUtilitiesforIGELO=
S12thatSupportSSOwithOkta"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"App=
sandUtilitiesforIGELOS12thatSupportSSOwithOkta"></span></span></h2>
<ul local-id=3D"bc76d392-fa17-4239-ba7a-d58864cda702">
<li local-id=3D"3dfa17dc-835f-4a48-a240-ead371caf4ba">
<p local-id=3D"12e6218f-be68-4912-a7fc-da9f500b8a7f">Web apps, e. g. Okta p=
ortal (SSO via Chromium)&nbsp;</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c2a7a4f0-2b84-4f9f-942a-5e03d829eb51">
<p local-id=3D"33bd33ec-458c-47b3-8604-af72e05f494c">Device login</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3b5dce90-5c43-4797-8762-771309e13416">
<p local-id=3D"a32f4226-5e84-4ec1-8850-c6de322ca447">Screenlock</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"cddd4c59-3837-4fc7-9302-a8ea82daeb72" id=3D"HowtoConfigureS=
ingleSign-On(SSO)onIGELOS12-AppsandUtilitiesforIGELOS12ThatSupportSSOwithPi=
ngIdentity/PingOneAppsandUtilitiesforIGELOS12thatSupportSSOwithPingIdentity=
">Apps and Utilities for IGEL OS 12 That Support SSO with Ping Identity / P=
ingOne<span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"HowtoConfigureSingleSign=
-On(SSO)onIGELOS12-AppsandUtilitiesforIGELOS12thatSupportSSOwithPingIdentit=
y"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"AppsandUtilitiesforIGELOS12=
thatSupportSSOwithPingIdentity"></span></span></h2>
<ul local-id=3D"7cb462cf-4566-45a3-a335-5b3236a8f575">
<li local-id=3D"b005d2fe-d4eb-487d-8032-9f70a8ebe7ed">
<p local-id=3D"ff356456-7a87-4d9e-b385-344ad7bbe8c4">Web apps (SSO via Chro=
mium)&nbsp;</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2190a4e2-9df2-45e7-8c7a-6c529a47910a">
<p local-id=3D"5cb5aa40-3699-45aa-a026-104ab036d2de">Device login</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ccf6fade-d2cc-4392-845a-1a467f4ca292">
<p local-id=3D"383d7784-7a94-428f-9ea2-fec08dc5866b">Screenlock</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"882c639f-b704-409e-8644-377d089504cf" id=3D"HowtoConfigureS=
ingleSign-On(SSO)onIGELOS12-AppsandUtilitiesforIGELOS12ThatSupportSSOwithOm=
nissaWorkspaceONEAccessAppsandUtilitiesforIGELOS12thatSupportSSOwithVMwareW=
orkspaceONEAccess">Apps and Utilities for IGEL OS 12 That Support SSO with =
Omnissa Workspace ONE Access<span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link" id=3D"Ho=
wtoConfigureSingleSign-On(SSO)onIGELOS12-AppsandUtilitiesforIGELOS12thatSup=
portSSOwithVMwareWorkspaceONEAccess"><span class=3D"confluence-anchor-link"=
 id=3D"AppsandUtilitiesforIGELOS12thatSupportSSOwithVMwareWorkspaceONEAcces=
s"></span></span></h2>
<ul local-id=3D"331e340c-8e51-45d1-9951-2b07b5d58d99">
<li local-id=3D"a9330d3e-cac6-4845-839b-bd3480c7d2b5">
<p local-id=3D"c2f3d782-37a8-4702-8d4d-48ac86cad03c">Omnissa Horizon (if Ch=
romium is used for authentication)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d6d0f80d-a496-4f5b-bf84-83fd7924fa80">
<p local-id=3D"7a986730-c71b-444d-bf33-e2f4385e21dd">Web apps (SSO via Chro=
mium)&nbsp;</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a34066d5-5046-4e94-9976-1b655da74321">
<p local-id=3D"4af5a39f-fec7-4eb3-ac86-667038429895">Device login</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0f730f3a-c0cd-4c2b-8224-0a24582df0e1">
<p local-id=3D"3c39843d-c0d6-4772-99ac-8b76de25f2f9">Screenlock</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"4a726e6d-3461-4978-af4e-0de66b05163b" id=3D"HowtoConfigureS=
ingleSign-On(SSO)onIGELOS12-AppsandUtilitiesforIGELOS12ThatSupportSSOwithOt=
herIdPsAppsandUtilitiesforIGELOS12thatSupportSSOwithGenericOpenID">Apps and=
 Utilities for IGEL OS 12 That Support SSO with Other IdPs<span class=3D"co=
nfluence-anchor-link" id=3D"HowtoConfigureSingleSign-On(SSO)onIGELOS12-Apps=
andUtilitiesforIGELOS12thatSupportSSOwithGenericOpenID"><span class=3D"conf=
luence-anchor-link" id=3D"AppsandUtilitiesforIGELOS12thatSupportSSOwithGene=
ricOpenID"></span></span></h2>
<ul local-id=3D"51473a32-11ca-4aea-b868-203718b8eb91">
<li local-id=3D"e185357e-ca0c-4458-b463-ef820ab7fa4d">
<p local-id=3D"8da600e6-55cf-4196-a321-a6e683f4ee09">Web apps (SSO via Chro=
mium)&nbsp;</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"53b1f01a-b079-46ce-aae7-8d3ad63bc3bf">
<p local-id=3D"e272f12c-e37e-453e-884c-29eb3a8ba332">Device login</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bb5fd4b9-6448-4c50-8745-9c53d630859c">
<p local-id=3D"9d649383-1142-42ec-86b0-24e747e6b300">Screenlock</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"ab802b84-ca94-4583-a67a-84f1b879a7d1" id=3D"HowtoConfigureS=
ingleSign-On(SSO)onIGELOS12-SettingUpSSOwithMicrosoftEntraID">Setting Up SS=
O with Microsoft Entra ID</h2>
<p local-id=3D"8ba85848-9683-43f2-b4b5-408723b6584c">To enable SSO with Ent=
ra ID on IGEL OS 12 devices, an Entra application must be registered first.=
 Then, you can configure IGEL OS 12 to use this application for authenticat=
ion; the Entra application is referenced via its Public Client Identifier.<=
/p>
<h3 local-id=3D"6cad7010-4144-4a74-9a19-b792e80b2ab7" id=3D"HowtoConfigureS=
ingleSign-On(SSO)onIGELOS12-RegisteringanEntraApplication">Registering an E=
ntra Application</h3>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"acde951f-a294-4f3c-80fa-8e9fd950a15a">
<li local-id=3D"d1bf8e8d-acd3-4382-84a2-3195cc62ee71">
<p local-id=3D"f6742e8f-764a-43d8-9c9c-1aaf75ad222a">In your Entra AD Porta=
l, go to&nbsp;<strong>App registrations &gt; New registration</strong>.</p>=
</li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"3a684f4e-b04e-4ba3-b41b-d26851c67130"></p>
<ol start=3D"2" local-id=3D"608991f4-7910-408e-9355-924070797152">
<li local-id=3D"3199d182-8571-4eb0-b9f4-c3d158495c36">
<p local-id=3D"9d0503a6-99e3-4b15-8f80-31d699f50ebd">Edit the data as follo=
ws and then click&nbsp;<strong>Register</strong>.</p>
<ul local-id=3D"2807c103-cfbb-49c0-ac17-c4e8e86cfa03">
<li local-id=3D"8ae7fdc6-f90a-49f6-af8a-38ef7eb0b119">
<p local-id=3D"6cf056cc-2ada-4081-bff7-b26193343453">Add a proper name for =
the application. Note that this name will be visible to the user once durin=
g the consent process for granting permissions.<span class=3D"legacy-color-=
text-default">&nbsp;In our example, "IGEL OS Single sign-on" is used as the=
 name.</span></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"66476ae4-4d12-442b-b84f-687b52884c57">
<p local-id=3D"59e28cd4-6460-4a18-b91b-8bdaae64f697">Select the option&nbsp=
;<strong>Accounts in this organizational directory only ([name of your orga=
nization's AD Portal]&nbsp;only - Single tenant)</strong>.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"aab409d5-1b7d-4c2a-92c0-4ca5a2df44ea">
<p local-id=3D"8c1f4637-e6e8-4d43-a167-21e90cdcf211">Under&nbsp;<strong>Red=
irect URI (optional)</strong>, select the option&nbsp;<strong><span class=
=3D"legacy-color-text-default">Public client/native&nbsp;</span><span class=
=3D"legacy-color-text-blue3">(mobile &amp; desktop)</span></strong><span cl=
