<h3 local-id=3D"adb813fc-d195-428e-b02c-e60ec98c2491" id=3D"HowtoConfigureS=
ingleSign-On(SSO)onIGELOS12-ConfiguringIGELOSforSSOwithMicrosoftEntraID">Co=
nfiguring IGEL OS for SSO with Microsoft Entra ID</h3>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"e626b618-d4b6-4844-b57b-e3568d0bd047">
<li local-id=3D"64d74fb3-5dc1-4e5b-8544-e812e81eeb2f">
<p local-id=3D"133ae992-bf45-42e6-92ca-533e904b6bfe">Go to&nbsp;<strong>Sec=
urity &gt; Logon &gt; Single Sign-On</strong>&nbsp;and edit the settings as=
 follows:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"d5553e10-3ac9-4276-97ed-1274ad92a050">
<li local-id=3D"585ed73e-303f-4fb2-acf0-90bc39117e40">
<p local-id=3D"e3c8a135-53b0-4f8d-84ad-2ee52470ec5e">Enable&nbsp;<strong>Si=
ngle Sign-On with Identity Provider</strong>.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9710b674-b24c-49a6-9e36-5f4b50fdbb25">
<p local-id=3D"06270294-e824-43d0-b0f1-635f951d296a">Set&nbsp;<strong>Ident=
ity Provider</strong>&nbsp;to&nbsp;<strong>Microsoft Entra ID</strong>.</p>=
</li>
<li local-id=3D"6efd273e-239b-474b-967d-79b63521c362">
<p local-id=3D"e81f7449-f614-43a7-b4c9-f04c0c84631e">Enter the&nbsp;<strong=
>Microsoft Entra ID Tenant Name/ID</strong>.&nbsp;<span class=3D"legacy-col=
or-text-default">This is the value you have obtained as&nbsp;</span><strong=
><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-default">Directory (tenant) ID</span></st=
rong><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-default">&nbsp;in Azure AD Portal.</s=
pan></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"71dfb735-b0bb-4788-9b0d-2f78fa123a49">
<p local-id=3D"280163ca-dbd0-479e-8376-f5a3031162fa">Set the appropriate&nb=
sp;<strong>Application (client) ID</strong>. You have obtained this value a=
s&nbsp;<strong>Application (client) ID</strong>&nbsp;in your Azure AD Porta=
l.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3a6a6af4-9e98-4f44-b3db-85cc615082da">
<p local-id=3D"275304ad-ba7f-450d-b933-88053e5928b3">Enter the&nbsp;<strong=
>Client secret</strong>.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"76e892f364d0">
<p local-id=3D"54ca20aa743f">Under <strong>Redirect URI</strong>, enter the=
 URI you have entered in the Microsoft Entra ID portal under&nbsp;<strong>R=
edirect URI (optional)</strong>, <strong>Public client/native&nbsp;(mobile =
&amp; desktop)</strong>.</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ol><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-left-wrapper con=
fluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confl=
