<p local-id=3D"97dc2f41-bf97-46af-be9d-50f4663cc586"></p>
<p local-id=3D"d20f147d4468"></p>
<ol start=3D"2" local-id=3D"143b8d35-e3c0-42ad-bb7f-db5137df6b2b">
<li local-id=3D"bfbe7bb5-9c15-4aa3-9e65-3183bfb80301">
<p local-id=3D"5de5e25e-fb3c-477f-9943-e83212003923">If you want to use an =
automatic desktop login with predefined credentials that are stored securel=
y on your endpoint device:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"0e060918-5ad3-4e96-887a-f9c4a9e5eb6a">
<li local-id=3D"18a97306-59d7-43a1-8bfc-d72a4251ed60">
<p local-id=3D"cf4ee2ea-7fb5-45b1-836a-cdeb9c927d6a">Enable <strong>Automat=
ically perform login</strong>.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6a5e6011-fca0-4dfd-a848-b84d32195337">
<p local-id=3D"ccf2cdce-9eb0-4829-b937-19ae7205897a">Under <strong>Username=
 for autologin</strong>, enter a user's name known to your IdP.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8b6121cb-a424-456d-a18e-31dda24c6330">
<p local-id=3D"670c0203-6bc1-417e-8067-f35da7811b71">Under <strong>Password=
 for autologin</strong>, enter the enter the corresponding password.</p></l=
i>
</ul></li>
</ol>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-not=
e">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-info=
rmation-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p local-id=3D"5ca49f28-0da5-4238-914e-f5d830d811fc">Please be aware that a=
fter the automatic desktop login, a fully unlocked desktop session will run=
 on your endpoint device. This feature should only be used for use cases wh=
ere no interactive login is possible. It is good practice to restrict this =
user's access to only the relevant components and data that are necessary f=
or the specific use case.</p>
<p local-id=3D"c55bd880-18c6-426c-84f7-151c2ba9e335">Please also note that =
Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA) is not possible when automatic login is e=
nabled.</p>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"4f7c6c83-5017-4ceb-b143-c2d3eb408ab6"></p>
<p local-id=3D"f23cfc15-355d-4914-afa7-e3dc9dc6b6d4"></p>
<ol start=3D"3" local-id=3D"535a4204-af44-4060-bc55-675d8a9a743b">
<li local-id=3D"a2bceac2-d8c3-4d55-be1a-c390bdb6058a">
<p local-id=3D"ee699bbf-f97a-4025-85b0-b7d0fdd92d99">Click&nbsp;<strong>Sav=
e</strong>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<strong>Save and close</strong>.<br>
The desktop of the device is terminated. The login screen is displayed.<br>
You can now use the&nbsp;<a href=3D"#AppsandUtilitiesforIGELOS12thatSupport=
SSOwithAzureAD">apps and utilities for IGEL OS 12 that support SSO with Ent=
ra ID</a>.<br>
For details on importing apps from the IGEL App Portal and installing them =
on IGEL OS devices, see&nbsp;<a class=3D"unresolved" href=3D"#">(en) IGEL U=
MS 12: Basic Configuration</a>.<br>
All methods of multi-factor authentication are available except the hardwar=
e token.<br></p></li>
</ol>
