<p local-id=3D"e60751f3027d"><br></p>
<ol start=3D"2" local-id=3D"3a9d26af-9036-475a-a6ad-f44d846bc197">
<li local-id=3D"2fe76111-2b4f-45cb-9b43-bc3dab909f63">
<p local-id=3D"79d6c045-7f53-466e-9092-9f69322227ba">If you want to use an =
automatic desktop login with predefined credentials that are stored securel=
y on your endpoint device:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"0714f4ab-6160-4d69-8a00-e22ee140432d">
<li local-id=3D"3ca39e60-a7d6-4d96-97f0-a5958fe1679c">
<p local-id=3D"ab4d8ff8-0ee7-43ef-a897-0f7242996662">Enable <strong>Automat=
ically perform login</strong>.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1a142485-19e5-45ef-b8bc-ae886193fb34">
<p local-id=3D"7c1efe06-cf2a-4dd1-a580-f78963ee0308">Under <strong>Username=
 for autologin</strong>, enter a user's name known to your IdP.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"08faf9af-728a-41e5-8c30-db104689c9ee">
<p local-id=3D"53790768-e220-49d5-9817-955d1a1df076">Under <strong>Password=
 for autologin</strong>, enter the enter the corresponding password.</p></l=
i>
</ul></li>
</ol>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-not=
e">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-info=
rmation-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p local-id=3D"2bfdef7a-7dcf-489c-8d87-ad5167fb37ac">Please be aware that a=
fter the automatic desktop login, a fully unlocked desktop session will run=
 on your endpoint device. This feature should only be used for use cases wh=
ere no interactive login is possible. It is good practice to restrict this =
user's access to only the relevant components and data that are necessary f=
or the specific use case.</p>
<p local-id=3D"36bcb5da-444c-49fb-a495-336b43d3bc8c">Please also note that =
Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA) is not possible when automatic login is e=
nabled.</p>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"4fc91edd-21f6-48ae-88dc-85e9d0cc5c59"></p>
<p local-id=3D"97a62a7b-386f-4f6e-aa6d-483edcf9cd46"></p>
<ol start=3D"3" local-id=3D"ec036ab1-7bff-4f2d-a721-7151a72016ce">
<li local-id=3D"dfc5f289-7bab-432e-95ba-ffbc3a7472ad">
<p local-id=3D"0ccea6bf-110e-4006-8f1e-5d2b0570cd0f">Click&nbsp;<strong>Sav=
e</strong>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<strong>Save and close</strong>.<br>
The desktop of the device&nbsp;<span class=3D"legacy-color-text-default">is=
 terminated after the profile is applied.</span>&nbsp;The login screen is d=
isplayed.<br>
You can now use the&nbsp;<a href=3D"#AppsandUtilitiesforIGELOS12thatSupport=
SSOwithOkta">apps and utilities for IGEL OS 12 that support SSO with Okta</=
a>.<br>
If you want to use&nbsp;multi-factor&nbsp;authentication, you can configure=
 this in the Okta console. The available methods are Google Authenticator, =
E-Mail, and Okta Verify.</p></li>
</ol>
<h2 local-id=3D"8b7cfea9-5ad4-44cf-adf2-84ffbcffae94" id=3D"HowtoConfigureS=
ingleSign-On(SSO)onIGELOS12-SettingupSSOwithPingIdentity/PingOne">Setting u=
p SSO with Ping Identity / PingOne</h2>
