<ol start=3D"4" local-id=3D"aeadb77f-24ce-4d7e-a148-2797146ac3a2">
<li local-id=3D"40683252-01f0-49ba-98a8-aaffbf4c63d2">
<p local-id=3D"ed346fd7-023d-4284-9d88-9cf9c94b8fbb">Edit the configuration=
 as described below and click&nbsp;<strong>Save</strong>.</p>
<ul local-id=3D"41fdc585-7b6b-41d2-9c03-50e964fe71e1">
<li local-id=3D"d64c8033-59e6-4dc6-979c-483898b2b081">
<p local-id=3D"af8811d3-1fae-4c14-9f26-f2470f1ac5fb"><strong>Response Type<=
/strong>: Select&nbsp;<strong>Code</strong>.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"603af838-d7b4-429e-a2a5-9b6901567dd9">
<p local-id=3D"a5fd44dd-7bc5-4853-8598-789f3cc39427"><strong>Grant Type</st=
rong>: Select&nbsp;<strong>Authorization Code</strong>&nbsp;and set&nbsp;<s=
trong>PKCE Enforcement</strong>&nbsp;to&nbsp;<strong>S256_REQUIRED</strong>=
.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"cb4bdb09-eb2c-4e0a-a4fe-8ac5b404eca8">
<p local-id=3D"ba33b633-d028-40cb-bb50-b8d3278647d0"><strong>Redirect URIs<=
/strong>: Enter the redirect URI you will define on your device later. It i=
s recommended to use <code>http://127.0.0.1/callback</code> rather than <co=
de>http://localhost/callback</code>.</p></li>
