<h3 local-id=3D"6b342500-ed74-435b-86ac-b3f9ff870753" id=3D"HowtoConfigureS=
ingleSign-On(SSO)onIGELOS12-ConfiguringIGELOSforSSOwithPingIdentity/PingOne=
">Configuring IGEL OS for SSO with Ping Identity / PingOne</h3>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"5d81accc-8c27-43c9-a05e-de55e9d7a752">
<li local-id=3D"45abeb94-bb51-493e-b95c-c7ba9e65cd8d">
<p local-id=3D"9002b633-ffdd-4457-b5aa-c920a5df4647">Go to&nbsp;<strong>Sec=
urity &gt; Logon &gt; Single Sign-On</strong>&nbsp;and edit the settings as=
 follows:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"d24f1385-ad13-4a26-957f-e7aca2b70788">
<li local-id=3D"31f94803-069c-438c-bdd8-d783c4fc8d47">
<p local-id=3D"714012ca-7359-4163-aa32-bcb553cb01cd">Enable&nbsp;<strong>Si=
ngle Sign-On with Identity Provider</strong>.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"76551566-7737-42aa-898f-072192eb3a35">
<p local-id=3D"874cd668-70bd-4785-85ec-a057fe15f6a9">Set&nbsp;<strong>Ident=
ity Provider</strong>&nbsp;to&nbsp;<strong>Ping Identity | PingOne</strong>=
.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e4448a87-a7d4-4022-91b2-76f6e68ad640">
<p local-id=3D"37629c1b-1676-45ac-83e2-1c23085daa29">Provide the&nbsp;<stro=
ng>PingOne issuer URL</strong>&nbsp;for your user. This is the&nbsp;<strong=
>Issuer</strong>&nbsp;URL provided in the Ping Identity configuration porta=
l. Example:&nbsp;<code>https://auth.pingone.eu/0815abc-xyz123456/as</code><=
/p></li>
<li local-id=3D"eb1de188-9d49-4e20-b500-1dbe42c04043">
<p local-id=3D"c2d4afa4-76b3-44c6-999d-ac20017f22c0">Provide the&nbsp;<stro=
ng>Client ID</strong>.&nbsp;<span class=3D"legacy-color-text-default">This =
is the client ID that was created in Ping Identity.</span></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b1d2b4bc-e61c-46dd-83f1-2c63f77a9fac">
<p local-id=3D"7efa3370-b6c9-453e-8791-6d4e902f92c9">Provide the&nbsp;<stro=
ng>Client secret</strong>.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"75e9731269e2">
<p local-id=3D"9fb4896595d2">Under <strong>Redirect URI</strong>, enter the=
 URI you have entered in the PingIdentity portal under&nbsp;<strong>Redirec=
t URIs</strong>.</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ol><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-left-wrapper con=
fluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confl=
uence-content-image-border image-left" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=
