<h3 local-id=3D"d7f52ff4-cd8e-47ec-8b7d-5481b257a5a8" id=3D"HowtoConfigureS=
ingleSign-On(SSO)onIGELOS12-ConfiguringIGELOSforSSOwithOmnissaWorkspaceONEA=
ccess">Configuring IGEL OS for SSO with Omnissa Workspace ONE Access</h3>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"0fd7e705-c2b5-48b3-9dd0-f8d1a6e89cd9">
<li local-id=3D"2ec641e6-4b3b-467d-ab25-142d9d8b5c6a">
<p local-id=3D"f33cb148-5996-432b-9bb2-1684afb01ee1">Go to&nbsp;<strong>Sec=
urity &gt; Logon &gt; Single Sign-On</strong>&nbsp;and edit the settings as=
 follows:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"bb082d7a-606d-460a-a85d-2f15cd634a45">
<li local-id=3D"0bbefd03-4440-41be-8b55-23ae59d9df89">
<p local-id=3D"9b2a850d-bdef-488a-b617-81ffb91b26b7">Enable&nbsp;<strong>Si=
ngle Sign-On with Identity Provider</strong>.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9a610941-3dae-4605-a5cd-96ddb00cf0a6">
<p local-id=3D"1def9ebb-38f9-4e61-941d-1b6add046cfa">Set&nbsp;<strong>Ident=
ity Provider</strong>&nbsp;to&nbsp;<strong>Omnissa Workspace ONE Access</st=
rong> (formerly <strong>VMware Workspace ONE Access)</strong>.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"22f98ad6-9cc7-449f-bb67-044884d362cd">
<p local-id=3D"237ea914-e0f8-454d-b6b6-d36af0aef3ba">Provide the&nbsp;<stro=
ng>Workspace ONE Access issuer URL</strong>&nbsp;for your user. Pattern:&nb=
sp;<code>https://&lt;YOUR WORKSPACE ONE ACCESS URL&gt;/SAAS/auth</code></p>=
</li>
<li local-id=3D"0cb99c28-9b09-477d-aab0-1e2ce7ab2bdf">
<p local-id=3D"abb3383b-15cc-4618-9ba4-3013c55a89b4">Provide the&nbsp;<stro=
ng>Client ID</strong>.&nbsp;<span class=3D"legacy-color-text-default">This =
is the client ID that was created in Omnissa Workspace ONE Access.</span></=
p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f2431573-c740-4676-b612-241b91419d30">
<p local-id=3D"4b4afe8e-0a9b-4cc0-81c6-84d07b676442">Provide the&nbsp;<stro=
ng>Client secret</strong>.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"56ce55193d6c">
<p local-id=3D"68e0a26483b8">Under <strong>Redirect URI</strong>, enter the=
 URI you have entered in the Omnissa Workspace ONE Access console under&nbs=
p;<strong>Redirect URI</strong>.</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ol><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-left-wrapper con=
