<p local-id=3D"06112e4a-ea9c-45f1-a04a-a060bb0466ed">If you want to use an =
automatic desktop login with predefined credentials that are stored securel=
y on your endpoint device:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"72e45122-a029-4400-b119-36b4b7adfa33">
<li local-id=3D"171126d7-6a74-47dc-84ac-9e201d95f5bd">
<p local-id=3D"90ed225e-ca6c-45a0-be32-2cfe3d855ac8">Enable <strong>Automat=
ically perform login</strong>.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3bc254c3-8401-42c5-ad11-102ab31796cd">
<p local-id=3D"47b2b42e-e50e-4228-862c-dfbfc649c667">Under <strong>Username=
 for autologin</strong>, enter a user's name known to your IdP.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ae5c715f-6113-421b-a5c3-18fce8f87a1f">
<p local-id=3D"c54dbfe0-ceab-4e02-b82f-77f622524851">Under <strong>Password=
 for autologin</strong>, enter the enter the corresponding password.</p></l=
i>
</ul></li>
</ol>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-not=
e">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-info=
rmation-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p local-id=3D"0b2556fa-cd55-42e2-b2bf-5d76789f7f57">Please be aware that a=
fter the automatic desktop login, a fully unlocked desktop session will run=
 on your endpoint device. This feature should only be used for use cases wh=
ere no interactive login is possible. It is good practice to restrict this =
user's access to only the relevant components and data that are necessary f=
or the specific use case.</p>
<p local-id=3D"70d91eba-78a7-4c4a-8d8a-fa42da3cad88">Please also note that =
Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA) is not possible when automatic login is e=
nabled.</p>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"532932f1-31e7-439c-8a33-e555e4e89edf"></p>
<p local-id=3D"5ff3869b-89d2-46af-962f-47962764671a"></p>
<ol start=3D"3" local-id=3D"7a3efff4-15fa-4afe-b019-c3ecf0f64e06">
<li local-id=3D"3e7f8cdc-b15b-4b7e-89f5-03c6953b9415">
<p local-id=3D"b2a5ae61-4a78-45b2-96d3-45593dd9a020">Click&nbsp;<strong>Sav=
e</strong>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<strong>Save and close</strong>.<br>
The desktop of the device&nbsp;<span class=3D"legacy-color-text-default">is=
 terminated after the profile is applied.</span>&nbsp;The login screen is d=
isplayed.<br>
You can now use the&nbsp;<a href=3D"#AppsandUtilitiesforIGELOS12thatSupport=
SSOwithVMwareWorkspaceONEAccess">apps and utilities for IGEL OS 12 that Sup=
port SSO with Omnissa Workspace ONE Access</a>.<br>
If you want to use&nbsp;multi-factor&nbsp;authentication, you can configure=
 this in the Omnissa Workspace ONE Access portal.</p></li>
</ol>
<h2 local-id=3D"6d98d787-a7b8-45f0-ac1b-ea76992ddadf" id=3D"HowtoConfigureS=
ingleSign-On(SSO)onIGELOS12-ConfiguringSSOwithOtherIdPsThatUseOpenIDConnect=
">Configuring SSO with Other IdPs That Use OpenID Connect</h2>
<p local-id=3D"8a1700b4-8470-4492-b489-0b1fdc6468fc">For setting up your ap=
plication or client, the exact procedure depends on the OpenID Connect solu=
tion you are using. Therefore, the settings in the IdP console can only be =
described generically.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"012db39a-6524-4ca6-bc60-9fafaccb5cea" id=3D"HowtoConfigureS=
ingleSign-On(SSO)onIGELOS12-SettingupYourApplication/Client">Setting up You=
r Application / Client</h3>
<p local-id=3D"4897304b-92ae-49c6-9233-dace3aa5ffdd">In your IdP console, e=
dit the parameters as follows (the exact parameter names will probably devi=
ate):</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"426" data-layout=3D"align-start" data-local-id=
=3D"5986cf87-c4ab-4a90-bc65-6d88afb65a53" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 159.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 267.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"150806a2-9b1c-4b0c-9567-90105c8c52f5">
<th data-local-id=3D"de34b50b-7643-4fcc-894d-03a569645d65" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"b530ace1-d6d1-4ae5-a5c3-b16e6ebb2cf7"><strong>Parameter</str=
ong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"3805977b-05f5-4a14-ad2e-481fa7af4254" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"70e1fa39-9717-4dec-9c1d-0772e83b7044"><strong>Values</strong=
></p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"07b15c72-1ab8-4771-84e5-3d5aa8a0fafc">
<td data-local-id=3D"b6eadbb4-cb7c-4e8b-8afe-f5ae2283959e" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8dbb3005-afa9-4f58-8f6a-41ee0ecadc13">Response type</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b3a4a262-4a17-4037-a36a-1c8ab60050fa" class=3D"conflue=
