</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"5675f3a4-7ae6-413e-82c6-a5e5d806e5c6">
<td data-local-id=3D"6b112ef0-8f96-494a-a4bb-eeac6dad0a91" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5f9c106d-48ce-44d2-8430-d1cc42002b0f">Redirect URI</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3dacaa75-8097-4e94-99f6-a907f3c7dae7" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7f90343914f8">The redirect URI you will define on your endpo=
int device later. It is recommended to use <code>http://127.0.0.1/callback<=
/code>, rather than <code>http://localhost/callback</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"aed07212-648c-4820-b3b4-8ae27e4fd103">
