<h3 local-id=3D"565eac31f2ed" id=3D"HowtoConfigureSingleSign-On(SSO)onIGELO=
S12-ConfiguringIGELOSforSSOwithGenericOpenIDConnect">Configuring IGEL OS fo=
r SSO with Generic OpenID Connect</h3>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-inf=
ormation">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-informa=
tion-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p local-id=3D"06316d6d-1158-40fa-86f5-09e5e6d2a708">Please note that autom=
atic login is not possible with generic OpenID connect.</p>
</div>
</div>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"7ef544db-803a-4f82-b2c2-c05d5eb2a552">
<li local-id=3D"068c9721-73fc-4036-9a57-4dce84beaada">
<p local-id=3D"df53477c-3ae7-472c-9da6-3e6aadc54a5f">Go to&nbsp;<strong>Sec=
urity &gt; Logon &gt; Single Sign-On</strong>&nbsp;and edit the settings as=
 follows:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"18eae3dc-48ac-4427-acc8-4e6424dfa8e6">
<li local-id=3D"95e4ff4e-174c-4f38-bdd8-e8981075606f">
<p local-id=3D"05f36cac-a45c-40f2-9708-3613238347c5">Enable&nbsp;<strong>Si=
ngle Sign-On with Identity Provider</strong>.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1fe9fe36-fe79-42b4-9786-c94028580743">
<p local-id=3D"3e022e11-fa3d-4354-a45a-8fe7000c49d1">Set&nbsp;<strong>Ident=
ity Provider</strong>&nbsp;to&nbsp;<strong>OpenID Connect</strong>.</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"92dac0e8-f85c-4b03-b848-a1e9eb282209">
<p local-id=3D"a242bcac-be3b-4fd6-806c-24590e787e2e">Provide the&nbsp;<stro=
ng>Issuer URL</strong>&nbsp;for your user. This is the&nbsp;<strong>Issuer<=
/strong>&nbsp;URL provided in the IdP console. Example for Keycloak:&nbsp;<=
code>https://keycloak.yourcompany.com/realms/yourrealm</code></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"702e503c-04b6-48a9-a90f-fa2819c8976c">
<p local-id=3D"49d45249-a354-4435-b0a0-c3331b61a426">Provide the&nbsp;<stro=
ng>Client ID</strong>.&nbsp;<span class=3D"legacy-color-text-default">This =
is the client ID that was created in&nbsp;</span><span class=3D"legacy-colo=
r-text-blue3">the IdP console</span><span class=3D"legacy-color-text-defaul=
t">.</span></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"33e62d01-bb0c-4e5a-96ed-a940987455a6">
<p local-id=3D"129ebc79-964a-4946-b5d7-2db426e9de78">Provide the&nbsp;<stro=
ng>Client secret</strong>.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"67e429935b9d">
<p local-id=3D"c6e2b4d622c9">Under <strong>Redirect URI</strong>, enter the=
 redirect URI you have entered in your IdP=E2=80=99s portal.</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ol><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-left-wrapper con=
fluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confl=
uence-content-image-border image-left" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=
=3D"b7233653d9cb87037e17aa5c2175b2a61e093f346b48ba11c095637b959e0b75" data-=
