source-id=3D"904265747" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-reso=
urce-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-202602=
10-135011.png" data-base-url=3D"https://igel-jira.atlassian.net/wiki" data-=
linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-i=
d=3D"73302505" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"31" data-media-id=
=3D"fc47743a-c47a-4666-a8ea-2acc3cf2e5a5" data-media-type=3D"file" height=
=3D"200"></span>
<p local-id=3D"85359719-e22b-48f5-bdbd-5ab5e3da4c45"></p>
<p local-id=3D"238b2d60-7fce-4e0f-a315-abd10e6b515b"></p>
<ol start=3D"2" local-id=3D"71b96dc4-8bbb-4a15-8278-c8f3b196174f">
<li local-id=3D"11abb017-beb0-480a-a8f0-be73a1e3506c">
<p local-id=3D"c6941037-1d4a-42b2-8e77-ca7e885ff0f1">Click&nbsp;<strong>Sav=
e</strong>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<strong>Save and close</strong>.<br>
The desktop of the device is terminated. The login screen is displayed.<br>
You can now use the&nbsp;<a href=3D"#AppsandUtilitiesforIGELOS12thatSupport=
SSOwithGenericOpenID">apps and utilities for IGEL OS 12 that support SSO wi=
th OpenID Connect (generic)</a>.<br>
For details on importing apps from the IGEL App Portal and installing them =
on IGEL OS devices, see&nbsp;<a class=3D"unresolved" href=3D"#">(en) IGEL U=
MS 12: Basic Configuration</a> .<br>
For supported multi-factor authentication methods, check the documentation =
of your IdP.</p></li>
</ol>
<h2 local-id=3D"1d9fbe53-ff66-40fb-a4c2-8cf7ea374788" id=3D"HowtoConfigureS=
ingleSign-On(SSO)onIGELOS12-EnablingLocalLogin(Optional)">Enabling Local Lo=
gin (Optional)</h2>
<p local-id=3D"43ffd480-b190-46f8-966c-00050c7ac4bb">To have a fallback opt=
ion if something goes wrong with SSO, e.g. a network failure, it is recomme=
nded to configure local login in addition.&nbsp;</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"b6b3231e-d5ab-4542-aed1-488209ab8102">
<li local-id=3D"beb67f63-8371-49c5-b27d-23ad38e94fa4">
<p local-id=3D"ea660a70-408b-47b4-a638-eda97c2df732">Open the profile confi=
gurator and go to&nbsp;<strong>Security &gt; Logon &gt; Local user</strong>=
.</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"a8dd77cf-ab0e-4d05-941a-141504495aa6"></p>
<p local-id=3D"a3925504-9027-4b4a-8cc2-2f92968eb08b"></p>
<ol start=3D"2" local-id=3D"1d644e50-19ed-453a-b903-f9786b59df77">
<li local-id=3D"9b250b20-8f73-4480-a17c-6f81cdf041e2">
<p local-id=3D"93a47c37-1a8c-4bb3-a8c0-842fec2c1a65">Activate&nbsp;<strong>=
Login with local user password</strong>&nbsp;and enter a password.</p></li>
</ol><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-left-wrapper con=
fluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confl=
uence-content-image-border image-left" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=
=3D"4ab6b37980c6ca5024e6bb19be356b2fcc88ee591e2be02c9c3cc17e785d183a" data-=
